    "failed receive leaves queued bytes/authority intact; copied outputs unspecified",
    "wait readiness is level, non-consuming and not capacity reservation",
    "blocking helpers retry one original absolute monotonic deadline and cancel token",
    "historical sender metadata plus current live/session/policy/route/deadline checks required",
